{
  "description": "Every Prometheus metric name the dashboards and alert rules may use (platform LLD §8.8; PAY-NFR-10; C21, C55, C63, C65). 'app' entries are created in our code: 'source' is the file and 'instrument' the OTel instrument name there, which tests/platform/test_dashboards.py greps for (and every instrument the code creates must be listed here). The Collector's Prometheus exporter adds '_total' to counters and the unit suffix ('s' -> '_seconds') to the name, and turns a histogram into '_bucket', '_count' and '_sum'. 'auto' entries come from OTel auto-instrumentation in pycommon.otel.setup_telemetry. 'external' entries come from exporters and the observability stack at the versions pinned in deploy/compose/compose.yaml; Collector 0.164 self-metrics have no '_total' suffix (C65).",
